      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "(c) 2008 Wiley-Liss, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "We present a series of 13 cases of stent treatment of a variety of ostial lesions including aortoostial, subclavian-internal mammary artery, and coronary artery bifurcation disease using the double-wire Szabo technique. We discuss relevant technical issues using this technique as well as potential advantages and disadvantages."
